495 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (From July to December 2024, I interned with the Emerging Markets Group at the Industry, Science and Technology International Strategy Center \(ISTI\) of the Industrial Technology Research Institute \(ITRI\). I assisted with industrial research on emerging economies, including data compilation and presentation development covering Taiwanese overseas investment projects, trade statistics, and tax incentives. I also participated in a project forecasting the future market size of electric commercial vehicles in Vietnam. Despite limited data availability, I applied macroeconomic indicators and cross-country comparisons to estimate sales volumes and market penetration rates. This internship deepened my understanding of real-world industrial applications and strengthened my analytical and logical reasoning skills.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
