/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (In the future, I aim to further study the financial system by deepening my understanding of local finance and evaluating the sources and evolution of capital misallocation through dimensions such as bank balance sheets, wealth management product allocations, and bondholder structures. I also plan to extend the analysis to the regional finance level, comparing how capital flows and real economic outcomes differ across provinces and financial environments under the joint influence of local government debt, regulatory policies, and financial innovation.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
